tions\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Blood Orange & Tonic<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>50ml Blood Orange<\/li><li>Top with Tonic Water<\/li><li>Fresh Berries<\/li><\/ul><p>Add ice to a tall glass. Pour in Blood Orange and fill up with Tonic Water. Briefly stir and then top with fresh berries.<\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/blood-orange\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/blood-orange\">cocktail page<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"ec1b1391-2ea5-46b3-9ace-b333f4f99398":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/